flowchart TD
    Start[Assessment received] --> Evidence{Mandatory evidence complete?}
    Evidence -->|No or stale| NA[NOT_ASSESSABLE]
    Evidence -->|Yes| Failure{Mandatory gate failed?}
    Failure -->|Yes| NoGo[NO_GO]
    Failure -->|No| Critical{Unresolved critical risk?}
    Critical -->|Yes| NoGo
    Critical -->|No| Conditional{Non-blocking actions remain?}
    Conditional -->|Yes| ConditionalGo[CONDITIONAL_GO]
    Conditional -->|No| Go[GO]